WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
A contract in minutes

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:09.001
Pick the deal type: services, sale, rent or a loan.

00:00:09.001 --> 00:00:11.601
Stages and checklist acceptance

00:00:11.601 --> 00:00:18.002
Split the deal into stages, each with a list of what must be done.

00:00:18.002 --> 00:00:20.602
Payment tied to results

00:00:20.602 --> 00:00:27.005
Payment follows the stages: accepted means paid.

00:00:27.005 --> 00:00:29.605
Evidence that lasts

00:00:29.605 --> 00:00:36.007
Photos, files and messages are attached to the stage and sealed with a trusted timestamp.

00:00:36.007 --> 00:00:45.009
Reputation built on facts

